                        "entry_id": "82d88bf5-c1e9-339f-995b-ce12a2e9e3cf",
                        "glosses": [
                            "выдержанный в определённом (как правило, в хорошем, привлекательном) стиле"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "ee505554-3ac5-4f63-8deb-aac4adebb757",
                        "source_entry_id": "82d88bf5-c1e9-339f-995b-ce12a2e9e3cf",
                        "source_sense_id": "1c82c28e-f7c8-34ef-87a0-8f70b18e9a73",
                        "target_lang_word": "stylish",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "stylish",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "527995cf-0fef-33ec-bfc7-e0529ea3968a",
                                        "entry_id": "db430cef-8ee9-309d-aa70-e26c0f21d3a2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Having style."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "035f332a-fd7f-325a-a374-dd208e0661d3",
                                        "entry_id": "db430cef-8ee9-309d-aa70-e26c0f21d3a2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Having elegance or taste or refinement in manners or dress."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "036958d7-aaa2-4a69-85c4-4b1ded6fbeb5",
                                                "sense_id": "035f332a-fd7f-325a-a374-dd208e0661d3",
                                                "text": "“[…] Did you ever see her? a smart, stylish girl they say, but not handsome. […]”"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "92873965-3ec5-4ae9-b2ce-c1786f54f0ae",
                                                "sense_id": "035f332a-fd7f-325a-a374-dd208e0661d3",
                                                "text": "[…] and that her darling boy, with his beautiful face and stylish air “beyond anybody else’s son in Middlemarch,” would be sure to get like that family in plainness of appearance and carelessness about his clothes."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "be9aae97-b5f5-479d-b8ae-06347a1d7aaf",
                                                "sense_id": "035f332a-fd7f-325a-a374-dd208e0661d3",
                                                "text": "“That’s it!” cried Clare, pleased to think that she had reverted to the real pronunciation. “What place is The Herons?”\n“A stylish lodging-house. ’Tis all lodging-houses here, bless ’ee.”"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6cac7746-f708-4d7f-9567-f262693c8f89",
                                                "sense_id": "035f332a-fd7f-325a-a374-dd208e0661d3",
                                                "text": "But I presume he was too stylish for me—he travelled for the firm, and had seen a great deal of society."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8e89d2f1-6f5e-3a78-a227-cb4d4d5873e0",
                                        "entry_id": "db430cef-8ee9-309d-aa70-e26c0f21d3a2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Having a particular directing style or cinematography."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "5fdb47fd-b272-4bfa-8d1c-3349e11a36e3",
                        "source_entry_id": "82d88bf5-c1e9-339f-995b-ce12a2e9e3cf",
                        "source_sense_id": "1c82c28e-f7c8-34ef-87a0-8f70b18e9a73",
                        "target_lang_word": "trendy",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "trendy",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e80b8160-c437-3ace-ae4a-651f7b175069",
                                        "entry_id": "b9fde4e1-72be-3d0e-8f36-06cde0b1be64",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Of, or in accordance with the latest trend, fashion or hype."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "informal"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ab83af33-50c3-4c3a-a835-6bea6bba3eaf",
                                                "sense_id": "e80b8160-c437-3ace-ae4a-651f7b175069",
                                                "text": "I hate those trendy pre-wrinkled shirts."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4fb84c0e-201e-45f4-8f2a-60cec42270b0",
                                                "sense_id": "e80b8160-c437-3ace-ae4a-651f7b175069",
                                                "text": "MDF and HDF – or medium-density fiberboard and high-density fiberboard – are two of the trendiest materials in woodworking these days."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ef8a110e-738b-4021-96a4-1dadbdc92fc2",
                                                "sense_id": "e80b8160-c437-3ace-ae4a-651f7b175069",
                                                "text": "Some people who go to trendy cafés lament getting stuck at the long central table that has to be shared, instead hoping they get a ‘private’ table. But that is foolish. On a recent trip to see family, I got stuck at the big table in a café, too; I ended up making a new friend there and learning about the surrounding town."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "trendy",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "208aded7-fcd5-341a-8894-294543326874",
                                        "entry_id": "e214dc6c-a97b-3728-a80b-e4bdb2c10660",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A trendy person."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "informal"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "19c8253a-8725-4fe2-ae64-778cac135489",
                                                "sense_id": "208aded7-fcd5-341a-8894-294543326874",
                                                "text": "They're the kids who care. Yet they're the bad kids, and the trendies, the ones who are too cool to let anything matter, are the good kids. It's all twisted around."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
